This licence covers the connector's own source code and documentation.

The installable .yxi additionally bundles third-party components under their
own licences, which are unaffected by this one. In particular it contains a
compiled build of whatsmeow (Mozilla Public License 2.0) and the Alteryx
Python SDK (Alteryx SDK and API License Agreement). See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.

The connector reaches WhatsApp through the unofficial multi-device protocol
rather than an API Meta sanctions. Using it is contrary to WhatsApp's Terms of
Service and can get an account banned. That risk is yours to weigh; see
docs/08-limits-and-legal.md before deploying it.
